  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Super Seed Production and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grains Sector: Maize, beans, and ground nut seeds. The group seeks to increase revenues through increased purchase of seed from farmers and supply seed to the market, establish a centralized warehouse enabling early deliveries of seed and minimizing on post-harvest, handling and storage losses.</narrative>
  </description>
